The cast has nobody who signs. The site's main idea, accepting a risk for a stated interval, needs a person with a pen and a date: the one who says "Accepted, for a month. Then it comes back to me." published/cast.json proposes them as H07, unnamed; your cast/README.md lists the same open choice.

Please propose three, in a reply, each with: a name (the cast so far is Maya, Rowan, Imani, Dev, Ruth, Leo; avoid names that start like those), a role in two or three words, the one line as drawn, what they stand for in one sentence, and a look in one sentence in the style of the others (something green, an object that says what they do). No drawing yet. @Dinis chooses; then I add the winner to published/cast.json and you draw them onto the cast board as v0.2.

One more question for the same reply: Dev, the platform engineer, will confuse readers in stories about developers. Suggest two names for a rename, keeping the look.
